  (text "A 0.5 mm pitch QFN with pads on four sides is not a two layer board." (at 18.0 27.08 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1ac2de8b-57a9-51d1-b39e-7aaa6e0dee56"))
  (text "A real iCE40 design drops each pin into an inner layer; this one has" (at 18.0 32.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1bb7d5c0-7edc-5562-8844-b6f7545e0116"))
  (text "no inner layer, so all 48 escape on the top at 0.2 mm track and" (at 18.0 37.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "57e21884-b0cf-5359-8706-1345b5fa29a9"))
  (text "0.2 mm clearance - a fine-line process, and the reason a 7 mm chip" (at 18.0 42.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6c692530-feaf-5c4e-a237-4c16f7235928"))
  (text "needs 25 mm of board around it before anything else can be placed." (at 18.0 47.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f76be8b2-7efe-5445-bbff-783159de774b"))
  (text "Two rails: 3.3 V in for the I/O banks, the codec and the flash, and" (at 18.0 52.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5e03d9c7-c1a3-5336-85f5-5adf8a65eee7"))
  (text "1.2 V from U3 for the core, with C15 and C5 on the two VCC pins and" (at 18.0 57.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b068273e-64b4-5dcf-bbf8-05773905b072"))
  (text "on VCCPLL - which the datasheet would rather see filtered from the" (at 18.0 62.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "154bcb59-4733-551b-9b33-cae76cbcfb3f"))
  (text "core rail than tied straight to it, and is a thing this board is" (at 18.0 67.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "89578fcd-db28-5fc1-bfe0-2c09c7ba6064"))
  (text "not doing." (at 18.0 72.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f2e1b4af-0cbf-5297-9f97-8a5a893d6602"))
  (text "U1 boots from U4 over its own SPI port; J3 is that bus plus CRESET," (at 18.0 77.88 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0e926ecf-a102-50a6-a2bb-1277f29deeb5"))
  (text "so the flash can be written in circuit. R1 and R2 hold CRESET and" (at 18.0 82.96 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "172e97ac-430d-5914-98d7-6b0d7f57e07e"))
  (text "CDONE up, both being open drain." (at 18.0 88.04 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d44e8dc3-8585-55fc-9658-3f1af9cd7c41"))
  (text "U2's mode pins are strapped to a rail rather than driven: 16-bit" (at 18.0 93.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5d279a64-1bd3-5012-b496-8e5639faca50"))
  (text "I2S, no de-emphasis, normal filter, un-muted." (at 18.0 98.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "457de1f5-18bf-58c5-af27-c86f793c9aa7"))
